      "writtenOn": "2023-05-22T14:59:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I understand having multiple views per texture would be better - but could views be re-used or shared between different images? If not, I\u0027m not sure what benefit we get from adding them on to the rsrc cache over just having a VulkanTexture house multiple imageviews.",
      "parentUuid": "bd426013_06a99563",
      "revId": "3084cfdbdb03921702500ec871288fcc0133a997",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
